<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>ethexposed — On-Chain Attack Detector</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@300;400;500;700&family=Bebas+Neue&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root {
  --bg:      #0c0c0c;
  --s1:      #131313;
  --s2:      #191919;
  --b1:      #222;
  --b2:      #2c2c2c;
  --red:     #ff3030;
  --red2:    #8b1c1c;
  --redglow: rgba(255,48,48,0.13);
  --amber:   #f5a623;
  --green:   #00e87a;
  --blue:    #4a9eff;
  --fg:      #efefef;
  --mid:     #777;
  --dim:     #3a3a3a;
  --mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
  --dis:  'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
  --sans: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font-family:var(--sans);min-height:100vh;overflow-x:hidden}
body::after{content:'';position:fixed;inset:0;background:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,transparent,transparent 3px,rgba(0,0,0,.025) 3px,rgba(0,0,0,.025) 4px);pointer-events:none;z-index:9000}

.wrap{position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:920px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px 80px}

/* HEADER */
header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:32px 0 22px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--b1)}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.logo-mark{width:34px;height:34px;flex-shrink:0}
.logo-mark svg{width:100%;height:100%}
.logo-name{font-family:var(--dis);font-size:1.7rem;letter-spacing:.05em;line-height:1}
.logo-name em{font-style:normal;color:var(--red)}
.logo-tag{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.55rem;color:var(--dim);letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:3px}
.hbadges{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.hb{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.55rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:2px;border:1px solid var(--b2);color:var(--mid)}
.hb-live{border-color:var(--red2);color:var(--red)}
.hb-live::before{content:'';display:inline-block;width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--red);margin-right:5px;vertical-align:middle;animation:blink 1.4s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes blink{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.15}}

/* HERO */
.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 340px;gap:48px;padding:60px 0 48px;align-items:center}
.hero-eyebrow{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.62rem;color:var(--red);letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.hero-eyebrow::before{content:'//';color:var(--dim)}
h1{font-family:var(--dis);font-size:clamp(3rem,6.5vw,4.6rem);line-height:.93;letter-spacing:.02em;margin-bottom:22px}
h1 .r{color:var(--red)}
h1 .g{color:var(--dim);-webkit-text-stroke:1px var(--b2)}
.hero-p{font-size:.88rem;color:#777;line-height:1.75;max-width:360px}
.pill-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:22px}
.pill{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.58rem;letter-spacing:.06em;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid var(--b2);color:var(--mid);white-space:nowrap}
.pill.hot{border-color:var(--red2);color:#cc5555;background:rgba(139,28,28,.06)}
.checks-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0;border:1px solid var(--b1);border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden}
.check-item{padding:11px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--b1);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:3px}
.check-item:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.check-item.check-soon{opacity:.45}
.check-name{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.68rem;color:var(--fg);font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.check-desc{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.58rem;color:var(--mid);line-height:1.5}
.soon-tag{font-size:.5rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim);border:1px solid var(--dim);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:2px}

/* INPUT */
.input-section{margin-bottom:48px}
.input-label{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mid);margin-bottom:10px}
.input-row{display:flex;border:1px solid var(--b2);border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--s1);transition:border-color .2s,box-shadow .2s}
.input-row:focus-within{border-color:var(--red);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--redglow)}
.input-pre{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.7rem;color:var(--mid);padding:15px 14px;background:var(--s2);border-right:1px solid var(--b1);user-select:none;display:flex;align-items:center}
input[type=text]{flex:1;background:transparent;border:none;outline:none;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.78rem;color:var(--fg);padding:15px 16px;letter-spacing:.03em}
input[type=text]::placeholder{color:var(--dim)}
.run-btn{font-family:var(--dis);font-size:1.05rem;letter-spacing:.14em;background:var(--red);color:#000;border:none;padding:0 30px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,transform .1s;white-space:nowrap}
.run-btn:hover{background:#ff5555}
.run-btn:active{transform:scale(.98)}
.run-btn:disabled{background:#444;color:#222;cursor:not-allowed}
.input-hints{margin-top:9px;display:flex;gap:18px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.58rem;color:var(--dim)}
.input-hints span::before{content:'→ ';color:var(--red2)}
.sample-link{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.58rem;color:var(--dim);margin-top:7px}
.sample-link a{color:#cc4444;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer}
.sample-link a:hover{text-decoration:underline}

/* LOADER */
.loader{display:none;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:56px 0;gap:18px}
.loader.on{display:flex}
.load-bar-bg{width:300px;height:2px;background:var(--b1);border-radius:1px;overflow:hidden}
.load-bar{height:100%;background:var(--red);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--red);animation:sweep 1.6s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes sweep{0%{width:0;margin-left:0}50%{width:65%;margin-left:0}100%{width:0;margin-left:100%}}
.load-label{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.62rem;color:var(--mid);letter-spacing:.12em;text-align:center}
.load-steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;width:300px}
.lstep{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.58rem;color:var(--dim);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;transition:color .2s}
.lstep.on{color:var(--red)}
.lstep.ok{color:#33aa66}
.lstep::before{content:'○';font-size:.5rem}
.lstep.on::before{content:'◉';color:var(--red)}
.lstep.ok::before{content:'●';color:var(--green)}

/* ERROR */
.error-box{display:none;padding:14px 18px;border:1px solid var(--red2);border-radius:3px;background:rgba(139,28,28,.08);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.63rem;color:#cc5555;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:20px}
.error-box.on{display:block}

/* RESULTS */
.results{display:none;animation:riseup .3s ease}
.results.on{display:block}
@keyframes riseup{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
.rhead{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:20px;align-items:start;padding:22px 0 18px;border-top:1px solid var(--b1);border-bottom:1px solid var(--b1);margin-bottom:36px}
.raddr-label{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.57rem;color:var(--mid);letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:5px}
.raddr{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.03em;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.4}
.raddr .ah{color:var(--fg)}
.raddr .am{color:var(--dim)}
.raddr .at{color:var(--fg)}
.rmeta{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.57rem;color:var(--dim);margin-top:7px;display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.rscore-side{text-align:right;flex-shrink:0}
.rscore-label{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.55rem;color:var(--mid);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:3px}
.rscore{font-family:var(--dis);font-size:3.8rem;line-height:1;letter-spacing:.04em}
.rscore.red{color:var(--red)}
.rscore.amber{color:var(--amber)}
.rscore.green{color:var(--green)}
.rverdict{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.58rem;margin-top:3px;letter-spacing:.07em}
.rv-red{color:var(--red)}
.rv-green{color:var(--green)}
.rv-amber{color:var(--amber)}

/* SECTION TITLE */
.sec-title{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px}
.sec-title span{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.58rem;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mid);white-space:nowrap}
.sec-title::after{content:'';flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--b1)}

/* CARDS */
.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:11px;margin-bottom:32px}
@media(max-width:620px){.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.checks-list{display:none}}
.card{background:var(--s1);border:1px solid var(--b1);border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;position:relative}
.card::before{content:'';position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:3px}
.card.crit{border-color:var(--red2)}.card.crit::before{background:var(--red)}
.card.warn{border-color:rgba(245,166,35,.22)}.card.warn::before{background:var(--amber)}
.card.ok::before{background:var(--green)}
.card.skip::before{background:var(--dim)}
.ci{padding:13px 15px}
.ctop{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;margin-bottom:7px}
.cname{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--fg);line-height:1.2}
.cbadge{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.52rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:2px;flex-shrink:0;font-weight:700}
.cb-crit{background:rgba(255,48,48,.1);color:var(--red);border:1px solid var(--red2)}
.cb-warn{background:rgba(245,166,35,.09);color:var(--amber);border:1px solid rgba(245,166,35,.28)}
.cb-ok{background:rgba(0,232,122,.07);color:var(--green);border:1px solid rgba(0,232,122,.22)}
.cb-skip{background:rgba(60,60,60,.3);color:var(--mid);border:1px solid var(--b2)}
.cdesc{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.62rem;color:#5a5a5a;line-height:1.55;margin-bottom:9px}
.cfinding{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.62rem;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:2px;line-height:1.5}
.cf-crit{background:rgba(255,48,48,.05);color:#cc5252;border-left:2px solid var(--red2)}
.cf-ok{background:rgba(0,232,122,.04);color:#3d8857;border-left:2px solid rgba(0,232,122,.2)}
.cf-warn{background:rgba(245,166,35,.05);color:#9a7022;border-left:2px solid rgba(245,166,35,.3)}
.cf-skip{background:rgba(40,40,40,.5);color:var(--mid);border-left:2px solid var(--dim)}

/* DETAIL ROWS */
.detail-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;margin-top:8px}
.dl-row{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.6rem;display:grid;padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--b1);color:#555;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.dl-row:last-child{border-bottom:none}
.dl-row.dust{grid-template-columns:1fr auto auto}
.dl-row.poison{grid-template-columns:1fr}
.dl-addr{color:#777;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}
.dl-amount{color:var(--amber);white-space:nowrap}
.dl-date{color:var(--dim);font-size:.55rem;white-space:nowrap}

/* POISON PAIR */
.poison-pair{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;padding:8px 10px;background:rgba(255,48,48,.03);border-radius:2px;border:1px solid rgba(255,48,48,.08);margin-bottom:6px}
.poison-pair:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.pp-row{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.6rem;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:baseline}
.pp-tag{font-size:.52rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--dim);width:38px;flex-shrink:0}
.pp-real{color:var(--green);word-break:break-all}
.pp-fake{color:var(--red);word-break:break-all}
.pp-note{font-size:.55rem;color:var(--amber);margin-top:3px;padding-left:46px}

/* APPROVAL TABLE */
.appr-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.6rem;margin-top:6px}
.appr-table th{text-align:left;color:var(--dim);padding:0 6px 5px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--b1);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:.08em}
.appr-table td{padding:6px 6px 6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--b1);color:#666;vertical-align:middle}
.appr-table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}
.at-token{color:var(--fg);font-weight:500}
.at-unlimited{color:var(--red);font-weight:700}
.at-large{color:var(--amber)}
.revoke-row{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.58rem;color:var(--dim);margin-top:8px;padding-top:8px;border-top:1px solid var(--b1)}
.revoke-row a{color:var(--red);text-decoration:none}
.revoke-row a:hover{text-decoration:underline}

/* EDUCATION SECTION */
.edu-section{margin-top:48px}
.edu-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:16px}
@media(max-width:620px){.edu-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.edu-card{background:var(--s1);border:1px solid var(--b1);border-radius:3px;padding:18px 18px 14px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.edu-card::before{content:'';position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:3px;background:var(--b2)}
.edu-card.attack::before{background:var(--red2)}
.edu-card.defense::before{background:var(--green)}
.edu-tag{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.52rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}
.edu-tag.t-attack{color:var(--red2)}
.edu-tag.t-defense{color:#2a7a50}
.edu-title{font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--fg);margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1.2}
.edu-body{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.63rem;color:#666;line-height:1.7}
.edu-body p{margin-bottom:8px}
.edu-body p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.edu-steps{margin-top:10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px}
.edu-step{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.6rem;color:#555;display:flex;gap:8px;line-height:1.5}
.edu-step-num{color:var(--green);flex-shrink:0;font-weight:700}
.edu-full{grid-column:1/-1}

/* DISCLAIMER + FOOTER */
.disclaimer{margin-top:40px;padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid var(--b1);border-radius:3px;background:var(--s1);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.6rem;color:var(--dim);line-height:1.7;display:flex;gap:10px}
.disclaimer::before{content:'!';width:16px;height:16px;border:1px solid var(--dim);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;font-size:.55rem;margin-top:1px}
footer{margin-top:36px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--b1);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.56rem;color:var(--dim)}
.foot-brand{font-family:var(--dis);font-size:.85rem;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--dim)}
.foot-brand em{font-style:normal;color:var(--red2)}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

<header>
  <div class="logo">
    <div class="logo-mark">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 36 36" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <circle cx="18" cy="18" r="15" stroke="#ff3030" stroke-width="1.2"/>
        <circle cx="18" cy="18" r="7" stroke="#ff3030" stroke-width="1" opacity=".6"/>
        <circle cx="18" cy="18" r="2.5" fill="#ff3030"/>
        <line x1="18" y1="2" x2="18" y2="10" stroke="#ff3030" stroke-width="1.2"/>
        <line x1="18" y1="26" x2="18" y2="34" stroke="#ff3030" stroke-width="1.2"/>
        <line x1="2" y1="18" x2="10" y2="18" stroke="#ff3030" stroke-width="1.2"/>
        <line x1="26" y1="18" x2="34" y2="18" stroke="#ff3030" stroke-width="1.2"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="logo-name">eth<em>exposed</em></div>
      <div class="logo-tag">on-chain attack detector · full history</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hbadges">
    <span class="hb hb-live">mainnet live</span>
    <span class="hb">client-side</span>
    <span class="hb">no tracking</span>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-left">
    <div class="hero-eyebrow">Ethereum security scanner</div>
    <h1>HAS YOUR<br>WALLET BEEN<br><span class="r">ATTACKED</span><span class="g">?</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-p">Full on-chain history analysis — from block 0. Paste any Ethereum address. No signup, no extensions, no wallet connection needed.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="checks-list">
    <div class="check-item">
      <div class="check-name">Dust Attack</div>
      <div class="check-desc">Micro-transactions sent to your wallet to track your addresses via chain analysis.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="check-item">
      <div class="check-name">Address Poisoning</div>
      <div class="check-desc">Zero-value transactions from addresses that mimic both your wallet prefix and your contact's suffix simultaneously.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="check-item">
      <div class="check-name">Unlimited Approvals</div>
      <div class="check-desc">Active ERC-20 allowances granting contracts unlimited access to your tokens.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="check-item">
      <div class="check-name">Fake Token Airdrop</div>
      <div class="check-desc">Tokens received from unverified contracts impersonating known projects.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="check-item check-soon">
      <div class="check-name">NFT Phishing <span class="soon-tag">soon</span></div>
      <div class="check-desc">Unsolicited NFTs with phishing URLs embedded in their metadata.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="check-item check-soon">
      <div class="check-name">Permit Phishing <span class="soon-tag">soon</span></div>
      <div class="check-desc">Off-chain ERC-2612 signatures granting allowances without visible on-chain transactions.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="check-item check-soon">
      <div class="check-name">Sweeper Bot <span class="soon-tag">soon</span></div>
      <div class="check-desc">Bots draining ETH the moment funds arrive in a compromised wallet.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="check-item check-soon">
      <div class="check-name">Sandwich Attack <span class="soon-tag">soon</span></div>
      <div class="check-desc">MEV bots frontrunning your DEX swaps to extract value from slippage.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="input-section">
  <div class="input-label">// Enter wallet address to scan</div>
  <div class="input-row">
    <div class="input-pre">ETH</div>
    <input type="text" id="addr" placeholder="0x..." autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"/>
    <button class="run-btn" id="runBtn" onclick="runScan()">SCAN</button>
  </div>
  <div class="sample-link">No wallet? <a onclick="loadSample()">Load a demo address</a></div>
  <div class="input-hints">
    <span>Full history from block 0</span>
    <span>Runs in your browser</span>
    <span>No data stored</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="loader" id="loader">
  <div class="load-bar-bg"><div class="load-bar"></div></div>
  <div class="load-label" id="loadLabel">Initializing...</div>
  <div class="load-steps">
    <div class="lstep" id="ls0">Fetching full transaction history</div>
    <div class="lstep" id="ls1">Fetching full token transfer history</div>
    <div class="lstep" id="ls2">Loading known token list</div>
    <div class="lstep" id="ls3">Scanning for dust attacks</div>
    <div class="lstep" id="ls4">Scanning for address poisoning</div>
    <div class="lstep" id="ls5">Scanning token approvals</div>
    <div class="lstep" id="ls6">Scoring suspicious tokens (Etherscan + DexScreener)</div>
    <div class="lstep" id="ls7">Building report</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="error-box" id="errorBox"></div>

<div class="results" id="results">
  <div class="rhead">
    <div>
      <div class="raddr-label">Analyzed address</div>
      <div class="raddr">
        <span class="ah" id="rH"></span><span class="am" id="rM"></span><span class="at" id="rT"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="rmeta" id="rMeta"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="rscore-side">
      <div class="rscore-label">Threats found</div>
      <div class="rscore" id="rScore">0</div>
      <div class="rverdict" id="rVerdict"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div id="rBody"></div>
</div>

<div class="edu-section" id="eduSection">
  <div class="sec-title" style="margin-bottom:16px"><span>// What these attacks are & how to stay safe</span></div>

  <div class="edu-grid">

    <!-- DUST ATTACK -->
    <div class="edu-card attack">
      <div class="edu-tag t-attack">⬤ Attack — Dust</div>
      <div class="edu-title">What is a Dust Attack?</div>
      <div class="edu-body">
        <p>An attacker sends tiny amounts of ETH or tokens — so small they're nearly worthless — to thousands of wallets simultaneously. The dust itself is harmless.</p>
        <p>The goal is what happens next: if you spend that dust (moving it along with other funds), the attacker can use chain analysis to <strong style="color:var(--fg)">link your addresses together</strong> and potentially de-anonymize you. Common tool for tracking high-value wallets.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

